{"product_id":"the-hunted","title":"The hunted","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the author of The Devil's Advocate comes this novel of suspense, in which hunters are turning up dead in the Catskill Mountains during big game season. A young female reporter and a reluctant young hunter join forces to find the truth about another hunter--one who stalks a surprising prey. Original.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Andrew Neiderman\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780743478298\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 20 x 180\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41763076997273,"sku":"9RG9780743478298","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-hunted-373108.jpg?v=1694792075","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-hunted","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}